{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":14,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"我看咱们上市公司的综合毛利率，生箔机和阴极辊大概20个点出头。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":15,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"表处理卖到一千多万，毛利率能做到什么水平？","semantic_type":"unknown","statement_role":"question","speech_role":"question","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":16,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"基本30左右，表面处理机的毛利率高一点。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":17,"status":"no_supported_item","reason_code":"empty_utterance","items":[]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":18,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"第二个问题，您说现在咱们还缺一个伯乐，得有人国内刚开始用，用了以后就突破了。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":19,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"不知道国内现在跟咱们对接的有哪些，谁有可能正儿八经开始用我们的设备？","semantic_type":"unknown","statement_role":"question","speech_role":"question","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":20,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"对接的其实很多，基本上您能了解到的头部企业都有合作。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":21,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"铜冠他们的上级单位铜陵有色跟我们西北有色签了战略合作，","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":22,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"所以他们下一步采购设备肯定从我们这儿买。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":23,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"铜冠是量产HVLP铜箔的企业，前期生箔机、溶铜系统基本都是买的我们的。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
